{"asset_key":"mn3/herohub_story_10414040","episode":"mn3","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10414040","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1041404001:1":{"text":"Are we camping? I should have notified my family...","source_cn":"准备扎营休息了吗？早知道就给家里捎个信了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x949D299ED0E6AA98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1041404001":{"text":"Are we camping? I should have notified my family...","source_cn":"准备扎营休息了吗？早知道就给家里捎个信了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x949D299ED0E6AA98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041404002:1":{"text":"I do stay out overnight sometimes when I'm out hunting, but if I don't let them know in advance, they might worry.","source_cn":"我打猎时偶尔会住在外面，但如果不提前说一声的话，家里人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5103C2D17EA2B7AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041404003:1":{"text":"My parents are gone, and my grandparents are getting old. It's tough for them to handle the little ones when they get rowdy.","source_cn":"我父母不在了，爷爷奶奶岁数也大了，家里小孩子闹起来他们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD075E6B1A90E230F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041404004:1":{"text":"I remember you mentioning having younger siblings.","source_cn":"我记得梅瑞特你说过，有弟弟妹妹的吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE49977F3744CFED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1041404004":{"text":"I remember you mentioning having younger siblings.","source_cn":"我记得梅瑞特你说过，有弟弟妹妹的吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE49977F3744CFED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041404005:1":{"text":"In the early days, Grandpa and Grandma tried their best, but their health wasn't the best, so I helped out a lot.","source_cn":"早年有爷爷奶奶帮忙照顾，不过他们身体也不是很好，只能说...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77A905186C99D6FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041404006:1":{"text":"But the younger ones getting older, and thankfully they've become more responsible. It makes things a lot better than they used to be. ","source_cn":"但弟弟妹妹岁数也大了，至少懂事了，比之前好过不少。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC43E98E0C04E53D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1041404006":{"text":"But the younger ones getting older, and thankfully they've become more responsible. It makes things a lot better than they used to be. ","source_cn":"但弟弟妹妹岁数也大了，至少懂事了，比之前好过不少。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC43E98E0C04E53D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041404007:1":{"text":"It can be tough at times with so many people to look after...","source_cn":"嗯，有时候会有点辛苦啦。毕竟太多人要我照顾了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19CE915A27880111","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041404008:1":{"text":"But seeing their smiles makes it all worthwhile.","source_cn":"但当看到他们的笑脸时，又会觉得很值得。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2725C3F42D3D5CB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041404009:1":{"text":"After all, having all these family members around at a time like this really is something to feel lucky about!","source_cn":"毕竟，在这个时候还能拥有这么多亲人在身旁，真是件很幸运...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA21DB421BA9282C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"What was it like?","source_cn":"拥有这么大的家庭是什么感觉呢？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB72D8199EB36FDB3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What was it like?","female":"What was it like?","variant_male_record_index":"62702","variant_female_record_index":"62703","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"It must be challenging.","source_cn":"很辛苦吧？","status":"matched_runtime_g